    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just takes even more time and energy from them too. the more they try to \"help,\" the more they're tied to my misery. i just want them to be free of it. if i wasn't here, they could finally just breathe and live their own lives without constantly checking on me or worrying. doesnt it make sense that the kindest thing would be to just let them go?",
