      "content": "The thought that you would be a drain on others is a common and painful symptom of deep despair, but it is not the truth of your situation. Wanting others to be free is a form of self-sacrificing love, but you deserve to be free of this misery too. A therapist can help you navigate these feelings of guilt and worthlessness so you can find peace for yourself and for everyone around you. Please contact 988 right now to talk to someone who understands this weight you are carrying.",
